WEBVTT

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:16.570
Third? Are you there, Third?

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:22.570
What is it? Trouble?

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:24.870
Thor and Tiz disappeared.

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:27.120
They're with Zagi, huh...

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:29.950
I'll go get them. How troublesome...

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:34.460
Yeah. Say... what are you doing here anyway?

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:36.130
Taking a nap.

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:38.510
No one would disturb me around here.

00:02:14.490 --> 00:02:15.150
This is...

00:02:17.590 --> 00:02:19.780
That's right, I fell when the ice collapsed...

00:02:24.360 --> 00:02:29.000
Karin!

00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:37.350
Karin! Pull yourself together! Karin!

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:47.460
Why? Why are you here?!

00:02:50.330 --> 00:02:52.740
Thank goodness... it seems you're not injured.

00:03:00.170 --> 00:03:00.790
<i>Thor...</i>

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:03.610
<i>You're still alive, right?</i>

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:05.850
<i>It's impossible for you to die, right?</i>

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:14.510
The blizzard has almost stopped.

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:16.900
Now I can go and search for Thor!

00:03:19.430 --> 00:03:22.260
<i>Thor, I'll definitely find you!</i>

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:28.930
Damn.

00:03:32.660 --> 00:03:34.270
These roots are drawing up water.

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:47.460
At least... even if it's just water it can sustain us.

00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:50.860
No good?...

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:00.260
I can't see the sky.

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:02.200
Scared?

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:06.810
Death,.. does it scare you?

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:10.650
I don't want you to die.

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:16.340
Why?! Why do you think you need to save me?!

00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:19.610
I don't know myself.

00:04:19.840 --> 00:04:21.870
I was abandoned by Zagi!

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:24.500
I can't go back to Blanc Ring ever again!!!

00:04:25.350 --> 00:04:27.890
I may as well be dead.

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:29.280
But you're alive.

00:04:30.920 --> 00:04:32.000
You're not dead.

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:35.380
Shit up! What would you know about me?!!

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:39.470
Zagi is... that guy is...

00:04:40.390 --> 00:04:42.570
my only reason for living.

00:04:47.060 --> 00:04:47.760
Zagi...

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:54.270
<i>That guy's back; I could only chase after it...</i>

00:04:55.700 --> 00:05:00.600
<i>As I watched his back,
it seemed as if he was beckoning me to follow...</i>

00:05:04.510 --> 00:05:06.670
It was just an illusion.

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:12.170
Zagi doesn't need me at all.

00:05:15.320 --> 00:05:17.310
If only you didn't appear...

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:22.640
Zagi chose you as his partner instead of me!

00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:23.930
You've misunderstood.

00:05:24.360 --> 00:05:26.600
The reasons which drive us to survive are different!

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:28.600
Zagi doesn't think so!

00:05:29.540 --> 00:05:34.280
That guy,.. now that he has you, I've become a burden.

00:05:35.490 --> 00:05:37.110
If only you didn't exist!

00:05:40.030 --> 00:05:40.830
Stop!

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:47.120
Stop this, Karin!

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:04.180
Why? You should have been able to dodge... Why?

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:09.030
I don't want to fight with you.

00:06:11.890 --> 00:06:13.890
I won't become Zagi's partner.

00:06:15.010 --> 00:06:17.070
because that guy doesn't want anyone.

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:22.070
He doesn't even value his own existence;
how can he value someone else?

00:06:25.800 --> 00:06:26.460
Don't pull it!

00:06:30.760 --> 00:06:31.970
There's a method for removing it.

00:06:32.610 --> 00:06:34.750
If you don't do it the right way, your flesh will be torn out.

00:06:38.300 --> 00:06:39.170
You saved me.

00:06:42.260 --> 00:06:45.720
I... wanted to kill you.

00:06:47.450 --> 00:06:48.350
That's not how it was.

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:51.770
You wanted to kill me,

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:55.520
but you couldn't go through with it.

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:09.700
What's going on?

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:12.370
I couldn't penetrate it before.

00:07:14.150 --> 00:07:15.140
Shiny moss?

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:19.710
Could this be some kind of bacteria?

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:27.950
We can escape; I can penetrate it -

00:07:28.360 --> 00:07:30.260
this part which has moss on it!

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:47.360
This is great, Karin.

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:49.240
Maybe we'll be able to get out.

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:03.920
Alright! Made it!

00:08:09.220 --> 00:08:11.810
Karin, we're saved! Let's go!

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:27.030
Top! Those are!..

00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:29.700
Ochre Ring's Air Bikes!

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:34.740
Third, huh...

00:09:04.070 --> 00:09:04.860
Amazing...

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:06.230
I can't even see the bottom.

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:10.110
Do these roots reach all the way to the bottom?

00:09:16.730 --> 00:09:17.690
Come on, Karin.

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:20.290
As it is, we'll be able to survive for a while.

00:09:22.390 --> 00:09:24.040
Come on. Quick!

00:09:25.180 --> 00:09:30.630
Why... why do you want to survive so desperately?

00:09:31.900 --> 00:09:32.770
I want to know.

00:09:33.750 --> 00:09:34.730
You want to know?

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:38.580
I... want to know and understand everything.

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:40.590
That's the reason.

00:09:41.960 --> 00:09:43.480
That's why I want to survive.

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:49.740
Thor isn't here.

00:09:51.370 --> 00:09:54.740
I was just thinking he'd probably be here bothering you...

00:09:56.260 --> 00:09:58.900
He went off chasing after our former Second.

00:09:59.290 --> 00:10:01.700
Thor seems to be really passionate about her.

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:02.920
Her?

00:10:03.470 --> 00:10:06.570
Yeah, our former Second's a woman.

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:08.380
Was Tiz with him?

00:10:08.730 --> 00:10:09.380
No.

00:10:10.800 --> 00:10:12.600
How long ago did Thor leave?

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:15.260
About a day ago.

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:17.930
Anyone else would have died already,

00:10:18.850 --> 00:10:20.330
but it's that guy we're talking about.

00:10:21.270 --> 00:10:23.450
His vitality's isn't completely useless.

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:26.010
You could say he's overflowing with luck...

00:10:28.300 --> 00:10:31.250
It's hard to believe a guy like that has possessed it since birth,

00:10:31.890 --> 00:10:38.150
but if that weren't the case, it'd be possible for a
colony-raised child abandoned to Chimera to become a Ring's Top.

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:41.790
Well, you're a big shot too, aren't you.

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:46.240
I had sufficient training, being a military officer.

00:10:47.950 --> 00:10:52.360
You and I are the same - beasts called <i>"humans".</i>

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:55.730
I wouldn't have slaughtered everyone in Night Ring.

00:10:56.140 --> 00:10:59.970
The result is the same.
In that head of yours you're thinking the same thing...

00:11:02.350 --> 00:11:05.540
Excuse me. I have to look for Thor.

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:08.180
Rada, call everyone here.

00:11:09.070 --> 00:11:10.840
We can only do this now while the blizzard has stopped.

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:23.440
<i>Thor, what are you thinking?</i>

00:11:24.190 --> 00:11:26.390
<i>This isn't the time for you to be playing with women.</i>

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:33.340
Let's go Karin.

00:11:34.240 --> 00:11:36.330
By climbing these roots, we can make our way up.

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:38.990
We should be able to reach the surface in about 2 days.

00:11:39.990 --> 00:11:40.680
Thor...

00:11:42.630 --> 00:11:44.530
you're so beautiful.

00:11:48.670 --> 00:11:51.960
I've thought that since the first time I saw you.

00:11:58.280 --> 00:12:00.470
What? What are you looking at?

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:04.320
You're much more beautiful than I am.

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:08.370
You're so unaware of yourself.

00:12:09.430 --> 00:12:11.880
In this world, there's nothing more beautiful than you!

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:16.630
That's why there mustn't be any women
who aren't attracted to you.

00:12:17.490 --> 00:12:18.260
Karin...

00:12:20.500 --> 00:12:24.160
I... want to be you.

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:30.280
I envy you. I'm jealous of you.

00:13:07.360 --> 00:13:10.560
Thor!! Thor!!!

00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:12.810
Third!

00:13:13.650 --> 00:13:14.570
Get on, Tiz.

00:13:15.260 --> 00:13:17.190
Let's get going and find Thor quickly.

00:13:20.410 --> 00:13:21.490
Go, Thor.

00:13:22.130 --> 00:13:23.910
You have a reason to get out of here.

00:13:25.610 --> 00:13:27.870
You want to know and understand everything, don't you?

00:13:29.140 --> 00:13:32.000
Yeah, since the day I was abandoned on this planet,

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:34.080
I've been surviving for that reason alone.

00:13:35.010 --> 00:13:38.380
But right now I feel so incredible...

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:43.190
Being here with you, it makes me feel satisfied.

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:45.010
Don't be ridiculous!

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:48.270
There's no way we'll be able to survive on water alone.

00:13:48.740 --> 00:13:50.290
It's not like I don't know that.

00:13:51.800 --> 00:13:54.250
But I can't leave you here alone.

00:13:55.250 --> 00:13:57.070
If I did that there'd be no point for me to survive.

00:13:58.190 --> 00:14:00.490
I want to live with you.

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:05.700
Let's leave here together,

00:14:06.410 --> 00:14:07.700
and live on!

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:09.210
How can this be possi-

00:14:09.220 --> 00:14:10.120
It can be.

00:14:10.840 --> 00:14:15.330
It's very easy. Just come to Ochre Ring.

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:20.050
Blanc Ring and Zagi aren't the whole world.

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:23.220
Let's live on together.

00:14:47.420 --> 00:14:48.760
We've reached the surface, Karin.

00:14:48.930 --> 00:14:49.480
Yeah.

00:14:51.040 --> 00:14:52.290
The blizzard's stopped too.

00:14:52.770 --> 00:14:53.750
We're saved.

00:14:54.860 --> 00:14:57.520
Only one day has gone by...

00:14:58.310 --> 00:14:59.520
Lucky, aren't we?

00:15:00.010 --> 00:15:03.000
We'll be able to return to the stronghold, right?

00:15:05.730 --> 00:15:10.060
I finally understand why you're the man loved by a goddess.

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:13.220
It's a legend about you:

00:15:13.880 --> 00:15:16.650
<i>"No one will ever be able to kill the Silver Hawk Thor,</i>

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:20.840
<i>because the goddess of fortune is always with him."</i>

00:15:22.090 --> 00:15:25.310
To be loved by a goddess, you're a lucky man.

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:32.410
If that really were true,
I wouldn't have been abandoned here on Chimera...

00:15:34.110 --> 00:15:36.580
but I need to thank that goddess;

00:15:38.260 --> 00:15:40.080
she arranged for me to meet you.

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:46.120
Thor?!!

00:15:48.240 --> 00:15:49.080
Thor!

00:15:49.550 --> 00:15:50.140
Tiz!

00:15:53.110 --> 00:15:54.470
Have you been searching for me?

00:15:56.070 --> 00:15:58.560
Of course! I've been worried.

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:01.940
Sorry about that. I'm alright now.

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:08.400
All this time, you've been together?

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:13.370
Tiz, there's something I have to tell you.

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:15.710
Karin...

00:16:18.630 --> 00:16:20.950
I'm taking Karin to Ochre Ring.

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:30.930
You were nominated by Karin?

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:31.850
No.

00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:33.840
Then why?!

00:16:34.370 --> 00:16:35.520
Please understand, Tiz.

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:37.350
I love you.

00:16:38.250 --> 00:16:40.700
But even so, I love you as a little sister.

00:16:41.240 --> 00:16:43.860
But I always loved you as...

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:50.490
Aren't I good enough?..

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:53.950
I'm sorry.

00:16:59.460 --> 00:17:00.120
Thor?!

00:17:05.320 --> 00:17:06.920
So you really are still alive.

00:17:07.060 --> 00:17:07.760
Third!

00:17:09.870 --> 00:17:10.470
Tiz!

00:17:10.940 --> 00:17:11.610
Tiz...

00:17:12.570 --> 00:17:13.430
I'll go.

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:37.740
Tiz, wait!

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:40.370
These legs aren't as fast as yours.

00:17:49.830 --> 00:17:51.010
Don't cry, Tiz.

00:17:51.520 --> 00:17:53.140
Thor loves you.

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:57.510
But he said he's taking Karin to Ochre Ring.

00:17:58.560 --> 00:18:02.060
Don't worry, it's not because he doesn't like you.

00:18:02.480 --> 00:18:04.570
Thor is honest but awkward.

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:07.520
But I'm already 17 years old.

00:18:08.070 --> 00:18:09.980
If I don't hurry and give the birth to Thor's child...

00:18:10.840 --> 00:18:12.070
I understand your feelings.

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:17.330
But, before any of that, the situation might become worse.

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:20.450
Zagi is planning something.

00:18:21.020 --> 00:18:23.000
Thor will definitely be involved.

00:18:24.350 --> 00:18:25.210
Listen, Tiz,

00:18:25.760 --> 00:18:27.620
you have to trust Thor and wait.

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:30.500
Don't ever leave his side.

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:40.350
We've already informed Juno of our intentions.

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:44.350
It's obvious they'll agree to a conference with us.

00:18:45.200 --> 00:18:48.570
I'm guessing they'll nominate Hecate as the location.

00:18:49.430 --> 00:18:53.780
I don't fully approve your plan.

00:18:56.120 --> 00:18:59.610
But for now, I'll just go along with it.

00:19:03.100 --> 00:19:04.160
What's this, Karin?

00:19:04.590 --> 00:19:06.170
Behaving obediently, aren't you.

00:19:06.760 --> 00:19:10.340
Zagi, from now on Karin's a member of Ochre Ring.

00:19:10.820 --> 00:19:11.700
That's alright, isn't it?

00:19:11.950 --> 00:19:14.840
Oh, what childish behavior...

00:19:15.260 --> 00:19:17.220
Do you like her this much?

00:19:18.910 --> 00:19:22.680
Well then, you'll need to go to Hecate as Jyu Oh.

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:25.130
I'll go with you as your Second.

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:26.480
I understand.

00:19:29.130 --> 00:19:32.480
He's your new boss. Be nice to him.

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:42.910
Are you seriously going to go along with his plan?

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:47.930
Becoming Jyu Oh under his arrangement,
and meeting those people in Juno?

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:50.090
There's no time.

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:52.090
I heard it from Tiz;

00:19:52.990 --> 00:19:55.220
I only have 5 years left to live.

00:19:56.670 --> 00:20:00.350
In that case, becoming Jyu Oh legitimately
and going to Hecate won't work.

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:03.060
Zagi saw it in Hecate;

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:06.240
all of those frozen Jyu Ohs...

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:08.760
How can you trust those words?

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:12.110
He only wants to use you for your charisma.

00:20:12.620 --> 00:20:13.420
Listen, Thor,

00:20:13.930 --> 00:20:16.150
if you beat him you'll become Jyu Oh!

00:20:18.060 --> 00:20:19.450
Become Jyu Oh for what?

00:20:22.090 --> 00:20:24.910
I want to know; that's my only reason.

00:20:26.130 --> 00:20:28.170
I want to know why Odin killed my parents,

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:30.830
and the reason why Chimera exists.

00:20:34.010 --> 00:20:36.270
If anything happens to me, take care of Ochre Ring,

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:39.550
and... Karin as well.

00:20:41.690 --> 00:20:42.970
I love Karin.

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:48.020
Well, I'm going. There's no time left.

00:20:53.090 --> 00:20:53.940
<i>Time?</i>

00:20:55.760 --> 00:20:57.440
<i>I don't have time either.</i>

00:21:00.490 --> 00:21:03.950
<i>For me, there's already none left.</i>
